   "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/chronomancy/timeline-threading.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Rethread the timeline, dealing %0.2f temporal damage to the target before moving on to a second target.\n\t\tRethread can hit up to %d targets up to 10 grids apart, and will never hit the same one twice; nor will it hit the caster.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.",
   "target": "重编时间线，对一个目标造成 %0.2f 时空伤害。然后再对半径 10 内的另一个目标造成等量伤害。\n\t\t重编时间线能击中至多 %d 个目标，不会重复击中同一个目标，也不会击中施法者。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/talents/chronomancy/timeline-threading.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    113
   ]
  },
  {
